a4su.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%87%83%E7%83%A7%E7%93%B6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/qfmvst9n4k4nx1pzuxb6erllnopa4su.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%87%83%E7%83%A7%E7%93%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/47/qfmvst9n4k4nx1pzuxb6erllnopa4su.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />燃烧瓶\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面、曲射\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1圈\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）对目标地点<font color=\"red\">1</font>圈内所有敌人，造成其<font color=\"red\">10%</font>最大生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，使地形格强制变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 1圈.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/fqdgppb0d4105h1tmiqwd26o09ippa8.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%